          "content": "If the seller declines your cancellation request, or if they've already shipped your item, you'll need to wait until you receive the item and then request a return. If your order wasn't canceled and you haven't received the item, you can report that the item hasn't arrived once the estimated delivery date has passed.\n\nYou can find more information in our Order cancellation policy.",
