          "content": "If the seller has already shipped your order or if it was purchased during an eBay Live event, they won't be able to cancel it. ## Cancel an order\n\nTip\n\nKeep in mind that if your purchase contains more than one item, the entire order will need to be canceled – you can't cancel individual items. If the seller has not yet shipped the order, you may be able to ask the seller to cancel your order.",
