          "id": "ebay-buyer-item-not-received#7",
          "doc_id": "ebay-buyer-item-not-received",
          "index": 7,
          "content": "## How to report an item that hasn't arrived through My eBay\n\nGo to your Purchases - opens in new window or tab and find the item.\n\nSelect More actions beside the item and then I didn't receive it.\n\nCheck the box beside I'd like a refund or I'd still like the item.\n\nEnter any additional information.\n\nSelect Send request.",
