          "index": 0,
          "content": "# Xử lý khi người mua chưa nhận được hàng\n\nIf the estimated delivery date for your order has passed and your item hasn't arrived, you can let the seller know by reporting that you didn't receive it. ## Check if your item is on its way\n\nIf your item hasn't arrived, you can track your order in Purchases. You can check the expected delivery date, the address it's being shipped to, and the latest tracking updates.",
