          "doc_id": "ebay-buyer-item-not-received",
          "index": 7,
          "content": "## Ask eBay to step in and help\n\nIf the seller hasn't responded, or hasn't provided a resolution after 3 business days, you can ask us to step in. You have up to 21 business days from when you opened the original request. Here's how you can ask eBay to step in:\n\nFind the item in your Purchases.",
