          "doc_id": "ebay-buyer-item-not-received",
          "index": 11,
          "content": "If you've already received a refund, get in touch with the seller about what to do next. For example, you could:\n\nSend the item back and keep the refund\n\nKeep the item and arrange to reimburse the seller\n\nHow to close your request\n\nGo to your Purchases - opens in new window or tab and find the item. Select See request details and then Close your request.",
