          "content": "# Tổng quan đổi trả và hoàn tiền cho người mua\n\nTo help you find the information you need, we've put together an overview of how the process works, with links to useful articles. When an item doesn't arrive or you need to return something:\n\nOpen a request to let the seller know that your item hasn't arrived, or that you want to return it. Try to work things out – we ask sellers to respond within 3 business days and resolve your request.",
