          "content": "Ask eBay to step in and help if the seller hasn't responded or things aren't resolved. ## Let the seller know by opening a request\n\nIf you want to return an item, or if something's gone wrong with your order, the first step is to open a request from your Purchase history. Most sellers are happy to work with you, but if you're unable to resolve an issue or the seller doesn't honor their stated return policy, you may be eligible for eBay Money Back Guarantee.",
