          "id": "ebay-buyer-returns-refunds#5",
          "doc_id": "ebay-buyer-returns-refunds",
          "index": 5,
          "content": "## If the seller wasn't able to help, ask eBay to step in\n\nMost of the time sellers will be able to resolve your issue, but if they haven't responded after 3 business days or they haven't been able to fix things for you, we're here to help. ## Ask eBay to step in and help for buyers\n\nWhen we step in, we'll review the details of your case and get back to you and the seller with our resolution. For more information about how eBay decides the outcome of a case, see eBay Money Back Guarantee.",
