          "index": 7,
          "content": "## How to ask us to step in\nSelect Ask eBay to step in and help, and follow the instructions from there.\n\nTip\n\nWhenever possible, we recommend resolving your buyer's issue and not asking eBay to step in. If it's counted as a case closed without seller resolution, it may affect your seller performance level.",
