          "doc_id": "ebay-seller-ask-ebay-step-in",
          "index": 11,
          "content": "## What happens after eBay steps in\nIf we determine that you are responsible for providing a refund to the buyer, we'll issue the refund and then seek reimbursement from you. You won't receive fee credits if this happens, and the case will be counted as \"closed without seller resolution\", which can affect your seller performance level.",
