          "id": "ebay-seller-ask-ebay-step-in#1",
          "doc_id": "ebay-seller-ask-ebay-step-in",
          "index": 1,
          "content": "## When you can ask eBay to step in\n\nOnce the buyer has let you know that they have an issue, you have 3 business days to respond with a resolution. After that, if the matter hasn't been resolved, either of you can ask us to step in and help. You don't have to ask us to step in immediately after the 3 business days though – if you're still working things through with the buyer, you generally have up to 21 business days after the request was opened to ask us for help.",
