          "id": "ebay-seller-ask-ebay-step-in#8",
          "doc_id": "ebay-seller-ask-ebay-step-in",
          "index": 8,
          "content": "You won't receive fee credits if this happens, and the case will be counted as \"closed without seller resolution\", which can affect your seller performance level. For more information about how eBay decides the outcome of a case, see our eBay Money Back Guarantee policy. If you don't agree with our resolution, you can appeal by providing new information within 30 calendar days of the case being closed.",
