          "content": " fairest way possible. We normally come back with an answer within 48 hours, though occasionally it might take longer if we need more information.\n\nOnce we've found a resolution, we'll let you and the buyer know the outcome and anything else you need to do. For example, we may ask the buyer to return the item to you in these situations:\n\nWe can't determine that the item received by the buyer match",
