          "content": "Make sure you report the buyer - opens in new window or tab and send the refund within 2 business days after receiving the item back. You can do this from the return request. Keep in mind that you're not eligible for fee credits when you deduct from the buyer's refund for a return that was used, altered or damaged, and you'll no longer see this option if eBay steps in to help with the return.",
