          "id": "ebay-seller-return-policy#1",
          "doc_id": "ebay-seller-return-policy",
          "index": 1,
          "content": "When you sell on eBay, you need to state whether you accept returns or not, and if so, under what conditions. For example, you might assert who pays for return shipping or that you’re willing to accept returns for a specific period of time after a sale. Whatever you decide your policy is, it needs to be clearly specified in your listings.",
