          "id": "ebay-seller-return-policy#0",
          "doc_id": "ebay-seller-return-policy",
          "index": 0,
          "content": "# Thiết lập chính sách đổi trả cho người bán\n\nYour returns rules options\n\nSetting your return approval and refund rules\n\nSetting your return address rules\n\nEU right of withdrawal\n\nTo save time when managing return requests, you can set up rules to automatically accept returns or send immediate refunds. When you sell on eBay, you need to state whether you accept returns or not, and if so, under what conditions. For example, you might assert who pays for return shipping or that you’re willing to accept returns for a specific period of time after a sale.",
